From: chasey-dev <ellenyoung0912@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] build: Fix CMake 4 compatibility

CMake 4 rejects compatibility with versions older than 3.5. Raise the
minimum required version to 3.5 so mwctl can be configured.

Signed-off-by: chasey-dev <ellenyoung0912@gmail.com>
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
 
 PROJECT(mwctl C)
 ADD_DEFINITIONS(-Os -Wall -Werror --std=gnu99 -g3)
